{"id":"746b177ad471e105","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski.md","title":"Rasiowa Sikorski","display":"thm-rasiowa-sikorski — Rasiowa Sikorski","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski","aliases":["58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski"],"display":"thm-rasiowa-sikorski — Rasiowa Sikorski","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[58-prop-chain-density]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-rasiowa-sikorski</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rasiowa-sikorski — Rasiowa Sikorski"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e1000a4d0dd2b92\" href=\"?note=5e1000a4d0dd2b92\" title=\"58-prop-chain-density\">58-prop-chain-density</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\)</span> (poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> (forcing order) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(p_0\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\">\\(D\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\\)</span> (dense-set sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S\\)</span> (typed dense-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e1000a4d0dd2b92\" href=\"?note=5e1000a4d0dd2b92\" title=\"58-prop-chain-density\">58-prop-chain-density</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S\\)</span> (forcing-filter predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\n\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\n\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to q\\in G\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\n\\land G\\neq\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p,q\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in G\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\land\n\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in G\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle p,q\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\to q\\in G\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rasiowa\\text{-}sikorski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p_0\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land D\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D(n),\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p_0\\in G\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(G\\cap D(n)\\neq\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rasiowa\\text{-}sikorski}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p_0\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land D\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{DenseIn}_S(D(n),\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists G\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ForcingFilter}_S(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p_0\\in G\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(G\\cap D(n)\\neq\\varnothing)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recursively choose a descending sequence beginning below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\">\\(p_0\\)</span> and meeting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(n)\">\\(D(n)\\)</span> at stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, then take the generated forcing filter.</li>\n<li>When a countable model's dense subsets are enumerated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>, this produces a generic filter over that model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","s